[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23701.31, "timestamp": "06:35:01", "text": "一切。所以很难"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23704.31, "timestamp": "06:35:04", "text": "我找到了，然后我就想，“哦，好吧。我会的。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23707.23, "timestamp": "06:35:07", "text": "清理干净就行了。我至少会打扫一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23710.548, "timestamp": "06:35:10", "text": "“东西。”然后它奏效了。然后我看到了它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23713.83, "timestamp": "06:35:13", "text": "在电线之间的内部。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23716.37, "timestamp": "06:35:16", "text": "我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23720.03, "timestamp": "06:35:20", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23723.51, "timestamp": "06:35:23", "text": "“咦？它怎么从我的椅子上飞到这儿了？”"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 23724.079, "timestamp": "06:35:24", "author": "@KosmikZethar", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/b_m56i87DkQCWoSLK8J6eGPlt0w4dJQYTlT9PaGPCOWZzEZaUiSe6Q-t3xsz9BESFJqhLP1oHg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "near ur extension wires, ur voice is bit crackin??"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23726.67, "timestamp": "06:35:26", "text": "一直到最左边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23729.5, "timestamp": "06:35:29", "text": "角落？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23732.27, "timestamp": "06:35:32", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23734.43, "timestamp": "06:35:34", "text": "疯狂的。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23755.51, "timestamp": "06:35:55", "text": "是延长线吗？对，就是耳机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23758.67, "timestamp": "06:35:58", "text": "不是指耳塞，而是指"}]